                                                "sense_id": "bc5d7358-9436-3c37-b8d0-0a37cd21f722",
                                                "text": "Pierre was a master swordsman, and could parry the thrusts of lesser men with barely a thought."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6c7f5b8e-ee14-3896-ab6b-443911087a59",
                                        "entry_id": "aba2869c-482f-353e-b6ec-5b5131bf4779",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A push, stab, or lunge forward (the act thereof.)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10f76aec-23ff-45ca-a001-adbed35ef392",
                                                "sense_id": "6c7f5b8e-ee14-3896-ab6b-443911087a59",
                                                "text": "The cutpurse tried to knock her satchel from her hands, but she avoided his thrust and yelled, \"Thief!\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00a659fc-8c5c-33fa-a2c3-f09f0098febe",
                                        "entry_id": "aba2869c-482f-353e-b6ec-5b5131bf4779",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The force generated by propulsion, as in a jet engine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d015535d-f6f1-4444-aaa7-142bad4c1ff3",
                                                "sense_id": "00a659fc-8c5c-33fa-a2c3-f09f0098febe",
                                                "text": "Spacecraft are engineering marvels, designed to resist the thrust of liftoff, as well as the reverse pressure of the void."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "29ef2ab0-7fb4-3861-9237-c461bb67ba62",
                                        "entry_id": "aba2869c-482f-353e-b6ec-5b5131bf4779",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The primary effort; the goal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c97f0dd9-4d65-4a9a-bbc3-69e1370241fa",
                                                "sense_id": "29ef2ab0-7fb4-3861-9237-c461bb67ba62",
                                                "text": "Ostensibly, the class was about public health in general, but the main thrust was really sex education."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea50a5d9-600e-44ab-bef3-e36774cc4b7f",
                                                "sense_id": "29ef2ab0-7fb4-3861-9237-c461bb67ba62",
                                                "text": "“The main thrust of it was that Britain is losing out, that Brexit it not delivering, our economy is in a weak position,” said the source."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c47e7b4-9efc-4796-b071-3141045d43a3",
                                                "sense_id": "29ef2ab0-7fb4-3861-9237-c461bb67ba62",
                                                "text": "As is normal for biopics, the movie takes liberties with the historical record, but the thrust of the narrative is not disputed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "thrust",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f68f9f35-6552-346f-9772-668f40405704",
