                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make advance with force."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88f9b9ac-6693-4296-97dd-916477f8a687",
                                                "sense_id": "f68f9f35-6552-346f-9772-668f40405704",
                                                "text": "We thrust at the enemy with our forces."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5963a1e-10a0-3153-a7cf-34de808acf10",
                                        "entry_id": "ae05e44e-b0c9-3015-89e6-af1798a1b4b4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To force something upon someone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86516396-b10d-4906-bdde-7b30aeafb8e0",
                                                "sense_id": "e5963a1e-10a0-3153-a7cf-34de808acf10",
                                                "text": "I asked her not to thrust the responsibility on me."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc1b6378-fad3-4687-870d-7075064a93dc",
                                                "sense_id": "e5963a1e-10a0-3153-a7cf-34de808acf10",
                                                "text": "It is my earnest hope that the bitter lessons China has learned may prove instructive to countries and governments, and especially those in Asia which now face the same threat of Communism. Often it is not easy for most people to realize the presence of this threat in their midst, and by the time they do, it may already be too late to prevent its thrusting them behind the Iron Curtain at least for a time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "843f696f-a94b-3877-9e23-599228204244",
                                        "entry_id": "ae05e44e-b0c9-3015-89e6-af1798a1b4b4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To push out or extend rapidly or powerfully."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9cca3630-c1d0-494b-9e21-e49dde3715dc",
                                                "sense_id": "843f696f-a94b-3877-9e23-599228204244",
                                                "text": "He thrust his arm into the icy stream and grabbed a wriggling fish, astounding the observers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69217e1d-312f-4955-b5ed-a3781bf1b202",
                                                "sense_id": "843f696f-a94b-3877-9e23-599228204244",
                                                "text": "Towers thrusting skyward."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a559d9d3-c164-4bba-bfb2-bf7123b19b42",
                                                "sense_id": "843f696f-a94b-3877-9e23-599228204244",
                                                "text": "Three chairs of the steamer type, all maimed, comprised the furniture of this roof-garden, with […] on one of the copings a row of four red clay flower-pots filled with sun-baked dust from which gnarled and rusty stalks thrust themselves up like withered elfin limbs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7012fada-65d9-36c0-8011-14a510542933",
                                        "entry_id": "ae05e44e-b0c9-3015-89e6-af1798a1b4b4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To push or drive with force; to shove."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3d918cd-0493-4807-a07a-6aea7fabec3a",
                                                "sense_id": "7012fada-65d9-36c0-8011-14a510542933",
                                                "text": "to thrust anything with the hand or foot, or with an instrument"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c551559-9dae-47d7-8311-6b002b035b22",
                                                "sense_id": "7012fada-65d9-36c0-8011-14a510542933",
                                                "text": "Into a Dungeon thruſt, to work with Slaves?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f9e77261-8aea-3de0-8cf9-39b2da866082",
                                        "entry_id": "ae05e44e-b0c9-3015-89e6-af1798a1b4b4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To enter by pushing; to squeeze in."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2ccddf3-a63d-45b2-a842-f41b4fcf085e",
                                                "sense_id": "f9e77261-8aea-3de0-8cf9-39b2da866082",
                                                "text": "And thrust between my father and the god."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4815acf-a09d-35b4-8dea-d9581cfce75e",
                                        "entry_id": "ae05e44e-b0c9-3015-89e6-af1798a1b4b4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To stab; to pierce; usually with through."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
